### 1. 管理员登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token); %}

### 2. 学生登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("studentToken", response.body.data.token); %}

### 3. 管理员新增资源类型
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource-types
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "创新空间",
  "description": "创新创业、项目路演、团队讨论空间",
  "sort": 5,
  "status": 1
}

### 4. 查询资源列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources?current=1&size=10&status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 5. 查询资源详情，走 Redis 缓存
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 6. 查询某资源某天的可预约时段，走 Redis 缓存
GET http://localhost:8080/api/slots?resourceId=1&reserveDate=2026-06-01
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 7. 管理员创建预约时段
POST http://localhost:8080/api/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 2,
  "reserveDate": "2026-06-01",
  "startTime": "19:00:00",
  "endTime": "21:00:00",
  "totalCapacity": 1
}

### 8. 学生提交预约：把 slotId 换成真实时段 ID
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/book
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": 1
}

### 9. 我的预约记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/mine?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 10. 取消预约：把 id 换成真实预约记录 ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "临时有事，取消预约"
}

### 11. 管理员查看全部预约记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/admin?current=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
